      "title": "Mobavenue AI Tech Limited Declares an Interim Dividend, Payable on or Before March 12, 2026",
      "body": "Mobavenue AI Tech Limited announced that Board of Directors of the Company, at its meeting held on February 11, 2026 considered and approved Declaration of an interim dividend of INR 0.50 per equity share of face value of INR 10/- each. The company has fixed February 20, 2026 as the \"Record Date\" for determining the eligibility of shareholders for payment of interim dividend on equity shares. The payment of the interim dividend shall be made on or\nbefore March 12, 2026.",
