      "date": "2025-11-21T00:00:00.000Z",
      "title": "Mobavenue AI Tech Limited announced that it expects to receive INR 999.999296 million in funding from Aman Shivraj Agro Industries Private Limited, A V Holdings, Ratnatraya Holdings, Pipal Capital Management Private Limited",
      "body": "Mobavenue AI Tech Limited announced private placement to issue offer and allot up to 9,19,117 equity shares  of face value of INR 10 each at an issue price of INR 1088 for gross proceeds of INR 999,999,296 by way of a preferential issue on November 21, 2025. The transaction includes participation from Amit Mishra for 1,33,088 shares, Pipal Capital Management Private Limited for 4,687 shares, Vinay Nagda for 1,10,294 shares, Jayprakash Gupta for 4,687 shares, Aman Shivraj Agro Industries Private Limited for 9,191 shares, AV Holdings for 1,37,868 shares, Ratnatraya Holdings for 45,956 shares, Vikram Sheth for 4,596 shares, Shubhra Saxena for 9,191 shares, M.J Construction for 4,59,559 shares. The transaction is approved by board of directors of the company.",
